以献公称祖，妻以康子谥夫。\n何必议郎博士，千秋万岁称呼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33513,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜读传灯杂书六言八首 其七","author":"刘克庄","text":"赠半山翁甚美，责临淄公不轻。\n大苏肯念旧恶，小宋犹有宿酲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33514,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜读传灯杂书六言八首 其六","author":"刘克庄","text":"悠然东篱把菊，登彼西山采薇。\n重华去我已久，神农没矣安归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33515,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜读传灯杂书六言八首 其五","author":"刘克庄","text":"麟经之笔既绝，蚕室之书遂行。\n聃非二子同传，齐鲁两生失名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33516,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜读传灯杂书六言八首 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"神秀元来得法，志公了不见几。\n半夜一钵南迈，明朝只履西归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33517,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜读传灯杂书六言八首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"达人蘧蘧梦觉，呆汉屑屑往来。\n剪断郭郎线索，送还赵老灯台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33518,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜读传灯杂书六言八首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"稍喜世缘渐薄，尚嫌家事相关。\n种子入豹林谷，庞公遁鹿门山。","collection":"宋","n